{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011Cgj59EjwBQs9CmjtCdrYP","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"*The ancient wooden door stands before you, its grain weathering centuries of silence. A single iron keyhole rests at its center, dark and waiting.*\n\n*You insert the key.*\n\n*A deep, resonant CLICK echoes through the chamber. The mechanism turns — tumblers falling like old bones settling into place. The door shudders, dust cascading from its frame in thin veils.*\n\n*Slowly, with the groan of ages, I swing inward.*\n\n*Beyond me: a corridor of pale light, stretching forward into the unknown. The air that passes through carries the scent of rain on stone, of places long sealed, now breathing again.*\n\n*I am open.*"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":41,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":153,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}